# Line endings, pinned for every checkout.
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS: the goldens of this repository are compared byte for byte — the JCS
# transcript, the wire fixtures, the JSON blocks of the contract document. A checkout that
# translates line endings changes exactly those bytes. `core.autocrlf=true` is the default on
# GitHub's Windows runners, so the corruption appeared on one platform only, after a ten-minute
# build, as a diff whose difference was invisible: `…"}` against `…"}\r`.
#
# LF in the repository, LF in the working tree, on every machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# `text=auto` already recognises the images by their content; this says it out loud.
*.png binary
